    "id": "thm-naturality-of-the-homological-serre-spectral-sequence",
    "defect_type": "existing-diagram-mathematics",
    "diagram_kind": "commutative square of Serre fibrations and induced spectral-sequence maps",
    "source": "items/thm-naturality-of-the-homological-serre-spectral-sequence.md",
    "source_sha256": "75baf8c2b7d760a40281beade6e73eec80c9faacca741a25e047aabd506bc4c3",
    "source_lines": {
      "29": "Consider a strictly commutative square of Serre fibrations",
      "30": "$$",
      "31": "\\begin{CD}E @>{u}>> E'\\\\ @V{p}VV @VV{p'}V\\\\ B @>{f}>> B'\\end{CD}",
      "32": "$$",
      "33": "over path-connected CW complexes, where $f$ is cellular, and fix a commutative",
      "34": "unital ring $R$. The map $u$ induces maps between the homological Serre spectral",
      "35": "sequences which commute with every differential and every next-page",
      "36": "identification. Under the canonical identifications of the preceding theorem,",
      "37": "the map on the second page is",
      "38": "$$f_*:H_a\\bigl(B;\\mathcal H_b(p;R)\\bigr)\\longrightarrow H_a\\bigl(B';\\mathcal H_b(p';R)\\bigr),$$",
      "39": "where the coefficient morphism is induced by the strict-fiber maps",
      "40": "$u_x:p^{-1}(x)\\to(p')^{-1}(f(x))$."
    },
