    "source_lines": {
      "36": "",
      "37": "1. **Naturality.** For an orientation-preserving pullback square",
      "38": "",
      "39": "   $$",
      "40": "   \\begin{CD} f^*E @>>> E\\\\ @VVV @VVV\\\\ B' @>f>> B\\end{CD}",
      "41": "   $$",
      "42": "   one has $e(f^*E)=f^*e(E)$.",
      "43": "2. **Orientation sign.** Over $R=\\mathbb Z$ and $m>0$, reversing the orientation of $E$",
      "44": "   negates the class: $e(E,-o)=-e(E,o)$."
    },
